{"id":"n65410-1-4","stage":2,"title":"수십 · 数十","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65410-1-4-1","ko":"사람이 얼마나 모였어요?","zh":"来了多少人啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"6","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모였어요?","meaning":"被召集，被集中","explanation":"모이다：被召集，被集中；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"모이다","audio":"/audio/ea6fae0a54340254cbe6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91162","senseId":"6","lemma":"모이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"用于数人数的单位。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"达到某个程度地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"ea6fae0a54340254","term":"모이다","zh":"被召集，被集中","audio":"/audio/ea6fae0a54340254cbe6.mp3","entryId":"91162","definition":"人们聚集在一起或加入某个团体。","pronunciation":["모이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/983d7379dc45c6cf9915.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65410-1-4-2","ko":"보기에 수십이 넘어 보여요. 한눈에 세기가 힘드네요.","zh":"看上去有几十个吧。一眼根本数不清呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"보기에","meaning":"看样子，看来","explanation":"보다：看样子，看来；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수십이","meaning":"数十，几十","explanation":"수십：数十，几十；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수십","audio":"/audio/ee142084f7809c8c1056.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65410","senseId":"1","lemma":"수십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넘어","meaning":"过，超过","explanation":"넘다：过，超过；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"넘다","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64524","senseId":"4","lemma":"넘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보여요.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한눈에","meaning":"尽收眼底，一览无余","explanation":"한눈：尽收眼底，一览无余；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"한눈","audio":"/audio/bf2a7bb30e98a0ada0bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84118","senseId":"2","lemma":"한눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세기가","meaning":"数","explanation":"세다：数；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"세다","audio":"/audio/98e8ee1f7a1fe33460bc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49075","senseId":"1","lemma":"세다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"힘드네요.","meaning":"难，困难，费劲，难以","explanation":"힘들다：难，困难，费劲，难以；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"2","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看样子，看来","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"由前面的话语所指的行动或状态来推算或表示即使不正确但知道。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"ee142084f7809c8c","term":"수십","zh":"数十，几十","audio":"/audio/ee142084f7809c8c1056.mp3","entryId":"65410","definition":"十的几倍的数目。","pronunciation":["수ː십"]},{"id":"bd8fe9471c90dfb8","term":"넘다","zh":"过，超过","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3","entryId":"64524","definition":"超出一定的标准或限度。","pronunciation":["넘ː따"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"bf2a7bb30e98a0ad","term":"한눈","zh":"尽收眼底，一览无余","audio":"/audio/bf2a7bb30e98a0ada0bf.mp3","entryId":"84118","definition":"用眼睛一次可以看到的范围。","pronunciation":["한눈"]},{"id":"98e8ee1f7a1fe334","term":"세다","zh":"数","audio":"/audio/98e8ee1f7a1fe33460bc.mp3","entryId":"49075","definition":"记算数量。","pronunciation":["세ː다"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"难，困难，费劲，难以","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"做某事不简单或不容易。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ae35df4ad3460879d091.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.44,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65410","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":82,"sequenceScore":2.2667,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看上去有几十个吧。一眼根本数不清呢。","来了多少人啊？","看来最近条纹T恤很流行啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["来了多少人啊？","看来最近条纹T恤很流行啊。","看上去有几十个吧。一眼根本数不清呢。"],"answer":2}]}
